#: src/Psi/Advice.php:85
msgid "Files are holding up the first paint"
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Advice.php:86
msgid "The browser has to download some CSS and JavaScript files before it can show anything, so visitors stare at a blank screen."
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Advice.php:87
msgid "Defer or delay non-essential scripts, inline the small amount of CSS needed for the top of the page, and remove plugins that load files on every page. A good caching or optimisation plugin can do much of this."
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Advice.php:91
msgid "Too much JavaScript the page does not use"
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Advice.php:92
msgid "Every script has to be downloaded and processed, even if the page never uses it. This slows loading and makes the page feel sluggish, especially on phones."
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Advice.php:93
msgid "Find which plugins or theme features add the scripts and only load them on pages that need them. Remove plugins you no longer use, and avoid sliders, page builders or widgets that load large libraries everywhere."
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Advice.php:97
msgid "Too much CSS the page does not use"
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Advice.php:98
msgid "Large stylesheets from themes and plugins delay the first paint, even though most of the rules are for other pages."
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Advice.php:99
msgid "Use an optimisation plugin that removes unused CSS per page, or stop plugins loading their styles on pages where they are not used."
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Advice.php:103
msgid "CSS or JavaScript files are not minified"
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Advice.php:104
msgid "Unminified files contain spaces and comments that make them bigger than they need to be."
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Advice.php:105
msgid "Turn on minification in your caching or optimisation plugin."
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Advice.php:109
msgid "Images are bigger than they need to be"
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Advice.php:110
msgid "Large images are the most common reason pages are slow. Visitors download far more data than the screen can show."
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Advice.php:111
msgid "Resize images before uploading, serve WebP or AVIF, and make sure your theme uses WordPress's responsive image sizes. An image optimisation plugin can convert existing images."
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Advice.php:115
msgid "Images below the fold load straight away"
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Advice.php:116
msgid "Images nobody can see yet compete with the content at the top of the page."
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Advice.php:117
msgid "Make sure images further down the page use lazy loading (WordPress adds it automatically unless a theme or plugin removes it)."
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Advice.php:121
msgid "Your server is slow to respond"
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Advice.php:122
msgid "Nothing can start until the server sends the first byte of the page. A slow response delays everything else."
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Advice.php:123
msgid "Turn on page caching, use a recent PHP version, and check for slow plugins. If it is still slow, your hosting plan may be too small or overloaded."
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Advice.php:127
msgid "The page redirects before loading"
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Advice.php:128
msgid "Each redirect adds a full round trip before the page can start loading."
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Advice.php:129
msgid "Link directly to the final address (for example https and with or without www, matching your WordPress Address setting)."
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Advice.php:133
msgid "Text files are sent uncompressed"
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Advice.php:134
msgid "HTML, CSS and JavaScript compress very well. Sending them uncompressed wastes bandwidth."
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Advice.php:135
msgid "Ask your host to enable gzip or Brotli compression, or enable it in your caching plugin."
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Advice.php:139
msgid "Browser caching is too short"
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Advice.php:140
msgid "Returning visitors download the same files again instead of reusing the copy they already have."
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Advice.php:141
msgid "Set long cache lifetimes for images, CSS, JavaScript and fonts, through your caching plugin or your host."
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Advice.php:145
msgid "The main image or heading appears late"
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Advice.php:146
msgid "Largest Contentful Paint is the moment visitors feel the page has loaded. It is one of Google's Core Web Vitals."
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Advice.php:147
msgid "Do not lazy-load the main (hero) image, give it high priority, make it smaller, and avoid sliders or animations at the top of the page."
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Advice.php:151
msgid "The page jumps around while loading"
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Advice.php:152
msgid "Content that moves as it loads makes people tap the wrong thing. Layout shift is one of Google's Core Web Vitals."
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Advice.php:153
msgid "Give images, videos, embeds and ads a fixed width and height, and avoid banners or cookie notices that push content down after it appears."
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Advice.php:157
msgid "Text is hidden while web fonts load"
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Advice.php:158
msgid "Visitors see blank space instead of text until custom fonts arrive."
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Advice.php:159
msgid "Use font-display: swap, host fonts locally, and load fewer font weights."
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Advice.php:163
msgid "Third-party scripts are slowing the page"
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Advice.php:164
msgid "Chat widgets, trackers, embeds and ad scripts run on other companies' servers and can block your page."
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Advice.php:165
msgid "Remove services you do not use, delay the rest until after the page loads, and replace heavy embeds (like videos) with a lightweight preview."
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Advice.php:169
msgid "Scripts keep the browser busy"
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Advice.php:170
msgid "While JavaScript runs, the page cannot respond to taps and clicks. Phones feel this the most."
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Advice.php:171
msgid "Reduce the number of plugins that add front-end scripts and delay non-essential scripts until the visitor interacts."
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Advice.php:175
msgid "The page has a very large amount of HTML"
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Advice.php:176
msgid "Thousands of elements take longer to lay out and make every interaction slower. Page builders often cause this."
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Advice.php:177
msgid "Simplify the page layout, remove hidden sections, and paginate long lists."
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Advice.php:181
msgid "The page is very heavy"
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Advice.php:182
msgid "The total download is large, which is slow and costly on mobile data."
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Advice.php:183
msgid "Start with the biggest files: usually images, videos, and large scripts."
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Advice.php:187
msgid "Files load one after another"
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Advice.php:188
msgid "When one file has to load before the browser discovers the next, the delays add up."
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Advice.php:189
msgid "Preload key files (such as the main font or hero image), preconnect to important third-party domains, and reduce nested CSS imports."
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Advice.php:193
msgid "The page is not set up for mobile screens"
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Advice.php:194
msgid "Without a proper viewport tag, phones add a delay to taps and show a zoomed-out page."
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Advice.php:195
msgid "Make sure your theme outputs a viewport meta tag. Most modern themes do."
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Advice.php:227
msgid "Performance issue"
msgstr ""

#. translators: %s: error message from the HTTP library
#: src/Psi/Client.php:64
#, php-format
msgid "Could not reach Google PageSpeed Insights: %s"
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Client.php:102
msgid "Google's daily limit for your API key was reached. Tests will continue tomorrow."
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Client.php:103
msgid "Google is limiting tests without an API key. Add your own free API key in Settings for reliable testing."
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Client.php:106
msgid "Google rejected the API key. Check it in Settings and make sure the PageSpeed Insights API is enabled for it."
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Client.php:109
msgid "Google refused the request. Make sure the PageSpeed Insights API is enabled for your API key and the key is not restricted to other sites or IP addresses."
msgstr ""

#: src/Psi/Client.php:113
msgid "Google could not load the page. It must be publicly reachable on the internet (local, staging and password-protected sites cannot be tested)."
msgstr ""

